  "changes": [
    "TimeZone::visit_offsets_at has full-history default. Validated transition providers binary-search the local timestamp plus/minus one day, include initial state and relevant future offsets.",
    "Month recurrence uses known Gregorian month length instead of converting the next month; Jan 1 is computed only for Day/Julian rules.",
    "Future-rule offset lookup extracts only the year from floor-divided signed i64 seconds. Valid Instant seconds fit i64; event ordering and adjacent-year windows stay unchanged."
  ],
